{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03015","headline":"在郡秋怀二首 一 · 张九龄","name":"在郡秋怀二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋风入前林，萧瑟鸣高枝。\n寂寞游子思，寤叹何人知。\n宦成名不立，志存岁已驰。\n五十而无闻，古人深所疵。\n平生去外饰，直道如不羁。\n未得操割效，忽复寒暑移。\n物情自古然，身退毁亦随。\n悠悠沧江渚，望望白云涯。\n露下霜且降，泽中草离披。\n兰艾若不分，安用馨香爲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03015.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03015","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}